            {
              "id": "1771417672583_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Generate high priority actionable insights for the Top 7 request shipments using this data:\n{{$context.$nodes.DATA_FOR_APPOINTMENT_ACTION.$output.result}} \n\nData Information:\nData on this nodes contains shipmentXid. Those shipments come from OTM and they are linked with WMS based on their appointment number.\n\nFor each shipment object, use the following information for the action fields:\n \n Title: \"Schedule Appointment\"\n  - shortDescription: \"Shipment {shipmentXid} doesn't have an appointment\",\n  - actionText: \"Schedule Appointment\",\n  - followUpCommand: ora.Invoke(\"scheduleappointment\", {\"action\":\"scheduleappointment\",\"shipmentXid\":\"{shipmentXid}\"})\n  - priority: true\n\nIF no requests are found:\nReturn an empty response with no data.\n\nOutput format: Return only the insight objects, nothing else."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Return Success"
          },
          "outcomes": {},
          "code": "RETURN_SUCCESS",
